# AI Chat Conventions

## Handler Flow

- Chat logic in `app/chat/request.ts`; routes call via `app/routes/api/chat.tsx`
- Env access: `context.cloudflare.env` for AI, VECTORIZE, RESUME_DATA_KV

## Validation and Sanitization

- Use Zod schemas from `app/schemas` (ChatRequestSchema, ChatQueryParamsSchema)
- Validate with `ChatRequestSchema.safeParse(rawBody)`; on failure return `createValidationErrorResponse(result.error)`
- Limits are enforced in schemas: MAX_PROMPT_LENGTH 1000, MAX_HISTORY_MESSAGES 12 (see `app/schemas/chat.ts`)

## AI Flow

1. Generate embeddings via `@cf/baai/bge-base-en-v1.5`
2. Query Vectorize for relevant sections
3. LLM: `@cf/meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct`
4. Fallback to full resume when vector search unavailable (e.g. dev mode)
